<title>FINLAND: KONECRANES TO OPEN SHANGHAI OFFICE 1997.</title>
<headline>KONECRANES TO OPEN SHANGHAI OFFICE 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish cranes maker KCI Konecranes International Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it will open a marketing office in Shanghai, China in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The new office will strengthen KCI Konecranes' presence in rapidly growing markets,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>The Shanghai office will market the entire range of Konecranes products but the emphasis will be on heavy industrial cranes for the steel industry and power plants and on harbour and shipyard cranes, the company said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
